{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.TowerSpanReduction","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.MonoidAlgebra.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Basic"],"declarations":57,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pair_law_disjoint_is_instance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pair_law_disjoint_is_instance","kind":"theorem","line":697,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L697-L703","doc":"The two `a, b` above are in the blocks the law is about, so the hand\ncomputation `pair_law_disjoint` is literally the instance\n`disjointBlock_sym R (n+1) a _ b _`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pair_law_same_block_fails","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pair_law_same_block_fails","kind":"theorem","line":684,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L684-L695","doc":"**The same element against ITSELF fails**: `tr (a * a) = 2 ≠ 1 = tr a * tr a`\nfor `a = 1 + t n`, because now the cross term is `t n * t n = 1`. So the\ndisjoint-block law is genuinely about disjointness, not a corollary of\nmultiplicativity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pair_law_disjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pair_law_disjoint","kind":"theorem","line":671,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L671-L682","doc":"**The law holding with non-zero traces on both sides**: `a = 1 + t n`,\n`b = 1 + t (n+1)` have `tr a = tr b = 1` and `tr (a * b) = 1`. The cross term\n`t n * t (n+1)` is the 3-cycle `s n s (n+1) ≠ 1` and contributes nothing. This is\nan instance of `disjointBlock_sym`, computed by hand. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.one_add_t_succ_mem_shifted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.one_add_t_succ_mem_shifted","kind":"theorem","line":668,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L668-L669","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.one_add_t_mem_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.one_add_t_mem_H","kind":"theorem","line":665,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L665-L666","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_one_add_t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_one_add_t","kind":"theorem","line":662,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L662-L663","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_t_mul_t_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_t_mul_t_succ","kind":"theorem","line":658,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L658-L660","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_mul_s_succ_ne_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_mul_s_succ_ne_one","kind":"theorem","line":651,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L651-L656","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.disjointBlock_sym_direct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.disjointBlock_sym_direct","kind":"theorem","line":594,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L594-L647","doc":"**The disjoint-block law, proved DIRECTLY** — an independent check of the\nreduction chain's conclusion in this model.\n\nThe reason it holds is `W_{<n} ∩ W_{≥n} = {1}`: for group elements `w ∈ W_{<n}`\n(supported on `{0..n}`) and `v ∈ W_{≥n}` (supported on `{n, n+1, …}`),\n`tr (w v) = [w v = 1]`, and `w v = 1` forces `w = v⁻¹` to be supported on the\nsingle point `n`, hence `w = v = 1`. So `tr (w v) = [w = 1][v = 1]`, and\nbilinearity finishes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.shifted_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.shifted_eq","kind":"theorem","line":582,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L582-L592","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.t_not_mem_shiftedUpTo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.t_not_mem_shiftedUpTo","kind":"theorem","line":568,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L568-L578","doc":"**The filtration GROWS**: `t N` is not in the stage `⟨t n, …, t M⟩` for\n`M < N`, since every element of that stage has zero coefficient at `s N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.disjointBlock_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.disjointBlock_sym","kind":"theorem","line":560,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L560-L564","doc":"**The disjoint-block law, derived through the reduction chain**\n`SandwichReduces → TowerSpan → DisjointBlockMultiplicative`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.towerSpan_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.towerSpan_sym","kind":"instance","line":555,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L555-L558","doc":"**The witness satisfies `TowerSpan`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.sandwichReduces_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.sandwichReduces_sym","kind":"theorem","line":495,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L495-L553","doc":"**`SandwichReduces` holds at every level of the symmetric-group tower.**\n\nFor `c` in the stage `⟨t n, …, t M⟩`, `t (M+1) * c * t (M+1)` lies in the stage\nplus single sandwiches. By linearity it suffices to take `c = of w` for a\npermutation `w` supported on `[n, M+1]`; then `s (M+1) * w * s (M+1)` is\nsupported on `[n, M+2]` and `doubleCoset` places it in `W` or in\n`W · s (M+1) · W`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.shiftedUpTo_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.shiftedUpTo_eq","kind":"theorem","line":486,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L486-L493","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_not_mul_hom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_not_mul_hom","kind":"theorem","line":477,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L477-L482","doc":"**The trace is NOT an algebra homomorphism** — the property the involution\nwitness lacked. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.quad_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.quad_sym","kind":"theorem","line":472,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L472-L475","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.symTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.symTrace","kind":"def","line":447,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L447-L470","doc":"**A `MarkovTrace` on the symmetric-group algebra tower**, with the identity\ncoefficient as trace and `z = z' = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.Hlev_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.Hlev_mono","kind":"theorem","line":443,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L443-L445","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.Hlev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.Hlev","kind":"def","line":439,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L439-L441","doc":"Level `n`: generated by `t 0, …, t (n-1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_not_mem_closure_of_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_not_mem_closure_of_lt","kind":"theorem","line":428,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L428-L435","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.coeff_eq_zero_of_mem_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.coeff_eq_zero_of_mem_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":410,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L410-L426","doc":"A coefficient outside `closure (gens I)` vanishes on `adjoin (agens I)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.of_mem_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.of_mem_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L401-L408","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.mem_span_of_mem_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.mem_span_of_mem_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":391,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L391-L399","doc":"Elements of `adjoin (agens I)` are linear combinations of the group elements\nof `closure (gens I)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.agens_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.agens_eq","kind":"theorem","line":385,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L385-L389","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.agens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.agens","kind":"def","line":382,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L382-L383","doc":"The generators indexed by `I`, in the group algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_mul_t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_mul_t","kind":"theorem","line":372,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L372-L378","doc":"Multiplying by a generator on the right reads off the coefficient at that\ngenerator: `tr (a * t m) = a (s m)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_mul_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_mul_comm","kind":"theorem","line":358,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L358-L370","doc":"**(T1)** The identity coefficient is a trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_t","kind":"theorem","line":355,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L355-L356","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_ne_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_ne_one","kind":"theorem","line":349,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L349-L353","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":345,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L345-L347","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_of_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_of_one","kind":"theorem","line":342,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L342-L343","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_one","kind":"theorem","line":338,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L338-L340","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff_apply","kind":"theorem","line":336,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L336-L336","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.idCoeff","kind":"def","line":329,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L329-L334","doc":"**The trace: the coefficient of the identity.** A linear functional, not an\nalgebra homomorphism (`idCoeff_not_mul_hom`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.t_mul_t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.t_mul_t","kind":"theorem","line":326,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L326-L327","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.t","kind":"def","line":323,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L323-L324","doc":"The `m`-th adjacent transposition as an element of the group algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.doubleCoset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.doubleCoset","kind":"theorem","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L263-L317","doc":"**The double-coset decomposition** `S_{k+1} = S_k ∪ S_k · s_k · S_k`, in the\nform needed here: a permutation supported on `[n, M+2]` is either in\n`W = ⟨s n, …, s M⟩` or of the form `a * s (M+1) * b` with `a, b ∈ W`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.mem_closure_of_suppIn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.mem_closure_of_suppIn","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L239-L261","doc":"**Generation.** A permutation supported on `[n, M+1]` lies in the submonoid\ngenerated by `s n, …, s M`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.gen_aux","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.gen_aux","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L164-L237","doc":"**Generation, interval form.** A permutation supported on `[n, n+k)` is a\nproduct of the adjacent transpositions `s m` with `n ≤ m`, `m + 1 < n + k`.\n\nOuter induction on `k`; inner induction on the distance `d` from the preimage\n`i` of the top point `n + k` to that point, multiplying by `s i` to push the\npreimage up by one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_of_mem_closure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_of_mem_closure","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L155-L162","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pts","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.pts","kind":"def","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L152-L153","doc":"The points an element of `closure (gens I)` can move. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_mem_closure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_mem_closure","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L148-L150","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.gens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.gens","kind":"def","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L145-L146","doc":"The adjacent transpositions indexed by `I`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.eq_one_of_suppIn_singleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.eq_one_of_suppIn_singleton","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L132-L141","doc":"A permutation moving at most one point is the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_swap","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L123-L130","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_mul","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L115-L121","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.suppIn_one","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L113-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.SuppIn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.SuppIn","kind":"def","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.lean#L110-L111","doc":"`u` moves only points of `S`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_s_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.SymmetricGroupTowerWitness.s_s_apply","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda9